OL,3,GNEWSACelebrating London's Make a
OL,4,ADifference winners
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Radio London's Make a Difference
OL,7,FAwards returned this year to celebrate
OL,8,Fthe people who go above and beyond for
OL,9,Ftheir communities.
OL,11,FThe awards shine a light on unsung
OL,12,Fheroes across eight categories,
OL,13,Frecognising volunteers, fundraisers,
OL,14,Fcommunity groups and individuals whose
OL,15,Fwork has made a lasting impact on the
OL,16,Flives of others.
OL,18,FLaunched during the first Covid
OL,19,Flockdown in 2020, the awards were
OL,20,Fcreated to connect those offering
OL,21,Fsupport with those who needed help.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
